 "plan": {
  "description": "the image tower in the NPUW-style split, one set of graphs per grid preset (grid = patches in height x width): HEAD (patches [N, patch_vector] -> hidden_states [1,N,hidden]: patch matmul + bias + the position embedding of the grid), BLOCK x depth (ONE graph, weights bound per layer: hidden_states -> next_hidden_states), MERGER (hidden_states -> image_embeds [1,N/4,out_hidden]). Patches are in merge-block order and in the (channel, temporal, kh, kw) order of the Conv3d kernel (protocol patchify). The external constants pos_embed (HEAD) and rope_cos / rope_sin (BLOCK) are the tensors of the manifest file with role vision_grid and this grid; the weights are the manifest files vision_head / vision_block (layer i) / vision_merger.",
